	key[]: "oversize_tutorial_intro"
	val[]: "You're about to haul a Special Transport cargo! There are two escort vehicles which will lead you. Please be careful and follow their lead and suggestion notifications. Special transports like this don't stop on a red signal and have the right of way in most situations. During these deliveries, checkpoints are made more often to save your current progress."

	#+ Oversize tutorial warnings sub-title.
